  "nord": {
    "source": "Nord (nordtheme.com/docs/colors-and-palettes), nord0 to nord15",
    "colours": {
      "nord0": "#2e3440",
      "nord1": "#3b4252",
      "nord2": "#434c5e",
      "nord3": "#4c566a",
      "nord4": "#d8dee9",
      "nord5": "#e5e9f0",
      "nord6": "#eceff4",
      "nord7": "#8fbcbb",
      "nord8": "#88c0d0",
      "nord9": "#81a1c1",
      "nord10": "#5e81ac",
      "nord11": "#bf616a",
      "nord12": "#d08770",
      "nord13": "#ebcb8b",
      "nord14": "#a3be8c",
      "nord15": "#b48ead"
    },
    "named": {
      "gray": {
        "kind": "derived",
        "value": "#81868f",
        "reason": "Nord has no gray. Its only greys that read on nord0 (nord4 to nord6) sit within 0.1 ΔE of the text colour nord6 (nord4 is 0.053), which R38 forbids. toneMatch(#bebdb8, nord, \"mark\") with the median of Nord's official named colours (red, orange, yellow, green, blue and purple; L 0.6947, C 0.0821): a neutral on Nord's window-to-text axis, 3.41:1 on nord0 and 0.33 ΔE from the text."
      },
      "brown": {
        "kind": "derived",
        "value": "#b28773",
        "reason": "Nord has no brown, and no official colour is within 30° of NotePane Dark's brown #8e6552 while 0.05 ΔE from the other eight (nord12 is the orange). toneMatch(#8e6552, nord, \"mark\") with the median of Nord's official named colours (red, orange, yellow, green, blue and purple; L 0.6947, C 0.0821) gives #bd927d, within 0.05 ΔE of nord12, so its lightness moved 0.035 toward #8e6552's (R35)."
      },
      "red": {
        "colour": "nord11",
        "kind": "own",
        "name": "red"
      },
      "orange": {
        "colour": "nord12",
        "kind": "own",
        "name": "orange"
      },
      "yellow": {
        "colour": "nord13",
        "kind": "own",
        "name": "yellow"
      },
      "green": {
        "colour": "nord14",
        "kind": "own",
        "name": "green"
      },
      "blue": {
        "colour": "nord9",
        "kind": "stand-in",
        "reason": "Nord names no blue; nord9 (Frost) is the nearest in hue to NotePane Dark's blue (13°)."
      },
      "purple": {
        "colour": "nord15",
        "kind": "own",
        "name": "purple"
      },
      "pink": {
        "kind": "derived",
        "value": "#b67a95",
        "reason": "Nord has no pink, and no unused official colour is within 30° of NotePane Dark's pink #da208f (nord15 is the purple, nord11 the red). toneMatch(#da208f, nord, \"mark\") with the median of Nord's official named colours (red, orange, yellow, green, blue and purple; L 0.6947, C 0.0821) gives #c588a3, within 0.05 ΔE of nord15, so its lightness moved 0.045 toward #da208f's (R35)."
      }
    },
    "derivedKeys": {
      "shadow": {
        "value": "#1e222a",
        "reason": "Nord has no colour darker than nord0, its window, so a nord0 shadow vanishes (R38). nord0 mixed 35% toward black: the median step from window to shadow in the other dark themes (Dracula 18%, Frappé 26%, Macchiato 35%, Mocha 42%, Tokyo Night 49%)."
      },
      "codeMuted": {
        "value": "#81868f",
        "reason": "codeMuted is gray in every theme's mapping, and Nord's gray is derived (R38); nord4 equalled codeText. Nord's brightened comment colour #616e88 (nord-visual-studio-code) reads only 2.43:1 on nord0; #81868f reads 3.41:1."
      }
    }
  },
